<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman starts CCU.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman starts CCU.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it initiated coverage of Chile's Cia Cervecerias Unidas SA with a market outperformer rating.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 1/8 at 16-1/8 in U.S. trading.</p>
